{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43238","headline":"送孙舍人归湘州 · 梁陟","name":"送孙舍人归湘州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"盛才倾世重，清论满朝归。\n作隼他年计，爲鸳此日飞。\n比肩移日近，抗首出郊畿。\n爲报清漳水，分明照锦衣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"梁陟","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43238.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43238","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}